TEXT -16 -40 Left 2 ;TS808 tone + level stage - SushiDSP spec D6c. Probe node: out.
TEXT -16 8 Left 2 !.param AMP=100m TONE=0.5 LEVEL=1\nV1 src 0 SINE(0 {AMP} 1k) AC 1\n* resonant leg: 220n into 1k\nC5 src tp1 220n\nR6 tp1 0 1k\n* 20k tone pot bridging the resonant node and the op-amp output; wiper feeds the summing node\nRta tp1 tw {20k*TONE}\nRtb tw tsout {20k*(1-TONE)}\n* low-pass leg: 10k into the summing node, 220n feedback, 10k DC feedback to bound it\nR7 tw inv 10k\nC6 inv tsout 220n\nRfb inv tsout 10k\nEop tsout 0 0 inv 1e6\n* 100k level pot and 1u output cap into a 100k load\nRla tsout lw {100k*(1-LEVEL)}\nRlb lw 0 {100k*LEVEL}\nCout lw out 1u\nRload out 0 100k\n.step param TONE list 0.1 0.5 0.9\n.options plotwinsize=0
TEXT -16 560 Left 2 ;ac dec 40 10 20k
TEXT -16 592 Left 2 ;tran 0 40m 20m 1u
TEXT -16 632 Left 2 ;The two lines above are the analyses tools/spice/export.py enables\nby rewriting their leading ';' into '!.' - exactly one at a time.
